{
  "source": "course-assets/embeddings/embeddings.mp4",
  "duration": 190.7413125,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 6.5,
      "text": "By now, you likely know that AI converts text into tokens, and assigns each one a unique"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.5,
      "end": 9.12,
      "text": "numerical identifier called a token ID."
    },
    {
      "start": 9.96,
      "end": 11.2,
      "text": "But there is a catch."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.88,
      "end": 15.32,
      "text": "That number tells us absolutely nothing about what the word actually means."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.26,
      "end": 17.62,
      "text": "Think of a high school cafeteria."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.06,
      "end": 19.52,
      "text": "An ID identifies you."
    },
    {
      "start": 19.72,
      "end": 20.86,
      "text": "It doesn't describe you."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.36,
      "end": 25.02,
      "text": "If four students are wearing badges, those numbers tell us who is who."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.42,
      "end": 29.64,
      "text": "But they tell us nothing about who is funny, who plays hockey, or who just stole"
    },
    {
      "start": 29.64,
      "end": 31.04,
      "text": "french fries off their friend's tray."
    },
    {
      "start": 31.92,
      "end": 34.54,
      "text": "So how can numbers actually represent meaning?"
    },
    {
      "start": 35.22,
      "end": 36.54,
      "text": "Let's use a taste test analogy."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.54,
      "end": 40.26,
      "text": "Imagine rating drinks on a scale from zero to 10,"
    },
    {
      "start": 40.42,
      "end": 42.34,
      "text": "where a higher number means a drink"
    },
    {
      "start": 42.34,
      "end": 43.8,
      "text": "has more of a certain trait."
    },
    {
      "start": 44.52,
      "end": 46.64,
      "text": "This table shows how we will structure the test."
    },
    {
      "start": 46.9,
      "end": 48.08,
      "text": "We have rows for the drinks,"
    },
    {
      "start": 48.16,
      "end": 49.38,
      "text": "and we will judge them"
    },
    {
      "start": 49.38,
      "end": 51.28,
      "text": "across six distinct characteristics,"
    },
    {
      "start": 52.0,
      "end": 55.88,
      "text": "sweet, bitter, fizz, heat, caffeine, and dark."
    },
    {
      "start": 56.5,
      "end": 58.24,
      "text": "You and your friends tasted coffee"
    },
    {
      "start": 58.24,
      "end": 60.14,
      "text": "and rated it on six characteristics."
    },
    {
      "start": 60.9,
      "end": 62.26,
      "text": "Let's put those ratings in the table."
    },
    {
      "start": 63.12,
      "end": 64.18,
      "text": "Next, you taste Coke"
    },
    {
      "start": 64.18,
      "end": 66.48,
      "text": "and rate it on the same six characteristics."
    },
    {
      "start": 67.16,
      "end": 68.98,
      "text": "Which drink scores nine for sweet,"
    },
    {
      "start": 69.38,
      "end": 70.88,
      "text": "one for bitter and 10 for fizz?"
    },
    {
      "start": 71.42,
      "end": 72.1,
      "text": "That is Coke."
    },
    {
      "start": 72.98,
      "end": 75.26,
      "text": "A row of numbers like this is called a vector."
    },
    {
      "start": 75.82,
      "end": 77.18,
      "text": "Each position is a dimension"
    },
    {
      "start": 77.18,
      "end": 79.16,
      "text": "and the number there is its value."
    },
    {
      "start": 79.88,
      "end": 81.7,
      "text": "Now let's add a third drink, Pepsi."
    },
    {
      "start": 82.4,
      "end": 83.96,
      "text": "Look closely at the resulting data."
    },
    {
      "start": 84.64,
      "end": 87.1,
      "text": "Pepsi's six values match Coke's exactly."
    },
    {
      "start": 87.1,
      "end": 91.82,
      "text": "If we hid the drink names, these numbers alone could not tell the two colas apart."
    },
    {
      "start": 92.42,
      "end": 95.3,
      "text": "To solve this problem, let us introduce a new column."
    },
    {
      "start": 96.02,
      "end": 98.02,
      "text": "Citrus gives us a seventh dimension."
    },
    {
      "start": 98.9,
      "end": 102.06,
      "text": "When we rate the drinks for citrus flavor, coffee gets a 0,"
    },
    {
      "start": 102.52,
      "end": 104.66,
      "text": "Coke gets a 1, and Pepsi gets a 10."
    },
    {
      "start": 105.28,
      "end": 110.18,
      "text": "The first six values still match, but their new seven-number profiles are distinctly different."
    },
    {
      "start": 111.0,
      "end": 114.2,
      "text": "Another dimension can capture a difference the earlier numbers missed."
    },
    {
      "start": 114.2,
      "end": 119.4,
      "text": "AI uses this exact same numerical approach to represent the meaning of words."
    },
    {
      "start": 119.98,
      "end": 121.74,
      "text": "That row is called an embedding."
    },
    {
      "start": 122.36,
      "end": 126.2,
      "text": "This comparison table maps our taste test directly to an AI model."
    },
    {
      "start": 126.9,
      "end": 128.98,
      "text": "In your test, every drink gets a row."
    },
    {
      "start": 129.4,
      "end": 133.58,
      "text": "In AI, every single token in the model's vocabulary gets its own row."
    },
    {
      "start": 134.14,
      "end": 137.1,
      "text": "For dimensions, your test used six, then seven."
    },
    {
      "start": 137.62,
      "end": 139.86,
      "text": "AI typically uses thousands of dimensions."
    },
    {
      "start": 139.86,
      "end": 146.24,
      "text": "While you chose values on a 0-10 scale, AI learns its values during training, utilizing"
    },
    {
      "start": 146.24,
      "end": 148.84,
      "text": "positive numbers, negative numbers, and decimals."
    },
    {
      "start": 149.56,
      "end": 153.08,
      "text": "Your taste test captured named traits, like sweet and fizz."
    },
    {
      "start": 153.76,
      "end": 158.28,
      "text": "AI captures complex, abstract patterns in how a token is actually used."
    },
    {
      "start": 158.86,
      "end": 162.96,
      "text": "And while you provided human labels for the columns, an AI model has none."
    },
    {
      "start": 163.38,
      "end": 165.76,
      "text": "The values simply work together to represent meaning."
    },
    {
      "start": 166.56,
      "end": 168.88,
      "text": "Both use a row of numbers to describe something."
    },
    {
      "start": 168.88,
      "end": 171.26,
      "text": "Even word fragments get their own embeddings."
    },
    {
      "start": 171.88,
      "end": 176.58,
      "text": "A long word, like unbelievable, splits into three separate token rows,"
    },
    {
      "start": 176.94,
      "end": 180.0,
      "text": "each containing its own sequence of learned numbers."
    },
    {
      "start": 180.86,
      "end": 183.04,
      "text": "AI uses numbers to work with meaning."
    },
    {
      "start": 183.62,
      "end": 187.04,
      "text": "Those numbers help AI recognize similarities and differences."
    }
  ],
